     [38;5;246mSmall server, one file database, no build step. Matches the plain-HTML starting point and keeps the whole app [39m
     [38;5;246mreadable.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Node + SQLite + a framework
     [38;5;246mSame backend, React or similar on the front. More ceremony and a build step, better if this grows.[39m
